# Raw captures = your machine's network fingerprint (internal IPs, EDR/VPN
# process names, agent destination topology). NEVER commit these.
tests/*.local.txt
sni.jsonl
activity.ndjson
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
docs/out/

# Cross-view experiment artefacts -- same rule: a list of every host this
# machine talked to is a network fingerprint.
xview-a.ndjson
xview-b.json
aes-etw-probe.*

# --- cross-view research, kept local until the write-up ---------------------
# The three docs and the harness are one unit: the code's comments cite the
# prereg by section, so splitting them would leave comments pointing at files
# that are not here. Excluded together, or included together.
PRIOR-ART.md
RESEARCH-PROGRAM.md
XV-PREREG.md
xview.py
xview_proxy.py
xview_capture.py
xview_report.py
tests/test_xview.py
